13
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,260
But on the surface there is no connection

14
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:29,680
This is just the shallowest way to come back to you

15
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:30,720
for the country

16
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:32,880
best protection

17
